Project Design Phase – PocketSmart AI
The Project Design Phase focuses on designing how PocketSmart AI: Your Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant will work. It defines the system structure, user interface, database, and major modules before development begins.
1. System Architecture
PocketSmart AI will have three main layers:
User Interface – Allows users to enter income, expenses, and budgets.
Application/AI Layer – Analyzes financial data and generates recommendations.
Database Layer – Stores user details, income, expenses, budgets, and savings goals.
2. Main Modules
User Management – Registration and login.
Income Management – Add and manage income details.
Expense Management – Add, edit, delete, and categorize expenses.
Budget Management – Set and monitor budgets.
AI Recommendation Module – Provides personalized spending and saving suggestions.
Reports & Analysis – Displays spending patterns and financial summaries.
Alert Module – Gives notifications when the budget limit is close or exceeded.
3. Database Design
The database can contain tables such as:
Users
Income
Expenses
Categories
Budgets
Savings Goals
Recommendations
4. User Interface Design
The application can include:
Login/Register page
Dashboard
Add Expense page
Budget page
Expense History
AI Recommendations
Reports/Charts
Savings Goals
5. Design Goal
The main design goal is to make PocketSmart simple, secure, user-friendly, and intelligent, so users can easily manage their money and receive useful recommendations based on their financial situation.
